00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:39.420
I'm an Emmy Award-winning editor on the show, and this was my directorial debut.
我是本剧获得艾美奖的剪辑师，这是我的导演处女作。

277
00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:41.380
And to my left here is-
在我左边的是——

278
00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:43.880
I'm Kyle Alexander, location manager for the show.
我是凯尔·亚历山大，本剧的取景经理。

279
00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.960
I'm Anthony Farrell, writer of this fantastic episode.
我是安东尼·法瑞尔，这一集精彩剧集的编剧。

280
00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:49.200
I'm Veda Samar, script supervisor.
我是维达·萨马，剧本主管。

281
00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:52.000
Been on the show for 99 episodes now.
已经在剧组待了99集了。

282
00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:57.320
And I'm Philip Shea, the property master, and I have also been on the show since the first season.
我是菲利普·谢伊，道具主管，我也从第一季开始就在剧组了。

283
00:10:57.320 --> 00:11:02.400
I'm Chuck Canzaneri, and this was my first full year as a production assistant on the funniest show on TV.
我是查克·坎扎内里，这是我作为制作助理在电视上最有趣的节目里工作的第一个完整年份。

284
00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:05.220
Oh my gosh, I love it!
天哪，我太喜欢了！

285
00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:07.540
I know, I love hearing their voices.
我知道，我喜欢听他们的声音。

286
00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:11.880
So whenever there's a crew commentary, I just want to let them introduce themselves
所以每当有剧组评论音轨时，我只想让他们自己介绍一下，

287
00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:15.640
because it just brings back so many feelings, just hearing their voices.
因为听到他们的声音总能勾起我很多回忆。

288
00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.860
When Dave introduced himself as the Emmy-winning editor,
当戴夫介绍自己是艾美奖获奖剪辑师时，

289
00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:24.200
it reminded me, Angela, that we were at that awards show, remember?
安吉拉，这让我想起我们当时在颁奖典礼上，还记得吗？

290
00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:24.580
Yes.
记得。

291
00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.760
