我们共同担任了颁奖嘉宾。

293
00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:28.620
Yes.
是的。

294
00:11:28.860 --> 00:11:33.580
And then we got to give the Emmy to our own editors, and then we partied all night with them.
然后我们把艾美奖颁给了我们自己的剪辑师，之后我们和他们彻夜狂欢。

295
00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:34.980
That was so much fun.
那真的太有趣了。

296
00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:36.980
That was one of the most fun award shows.
那是最好玩的颁奖典礼之一。

297
00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:38.000
Absolutely.
绝对是。

298
00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:38.520
Yeah.
是啊。

299
00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:39.560
Without a doubt.
毫无疑问。

300
00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:40.000
Yeah.
没错。

301
00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.740
So that is who does the DVD commentary for this episode.
原来这一集的DVD评论音轨是他们做的。

302
00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:44.400
I'll sprinkle in tidbits they share.
我会穿插分享一些他们提到的趣事。

303
00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:51.280
And then also, you guys, the bloopers for this episode are some of my most favorite of all bloopers.
还有，伙计们，这一集的NG花絮是我最喜欢的花絮之一。

304
00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:54.460
And you can't find them online, you know?
你们在网上是找不到的，知道吗？

305
00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:55.400
They're not all there.
网上并没有全部收录。

306
00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:59.540
So the bonus for this episode on the DVD box set is so great.
所以DVD套装里这一集的特别收录内容真的很棒。

307
00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:04.340
I wish all of the driving scenes had been left in because they are all gold.
我真希望所有的开车戏份都能保留下来，因为它们全是精华。

308
00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:10.800
I am bummed because I have every DVD set for every season except this one.
我很沮丧，因为除了这一季，我买了每一季的DVD套装。

309
00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:11.320
What?
什么？

310
00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:13.920
I don't know where my season five DVD went.
我不知道我的第五季DVD去哪儿了。

311
00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:14.860
Oh, lady.
噢，天哪。

312
00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:15.640
I know.
我知道。

313
00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:19.500
Well, while we take a break, maybe I'll order that DVD, Ange.
好吧，趁我们休息的时候，安吉，也许我会订购那套DVD。

314
00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:20.100
Yeah.
好啊。

315
00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.540
So I can watch these bloopers.
这样我就能看这些花絮了。

316
00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:22.840
These bloopers are my favorite.
这些花絮是我的最爱。

317
00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:24.180
Some of my absolute favorite.
我绝对最喜欢的一些花絮。

318
00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:24.580
All right.
好的。

319
00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:25.120
